Subject: [PATCH] docs(rules): point section numbers at the D10 file

Three references in the protected rule files attribute section numbers to
DECISIONS.md. DECISIONS.md D10 is a prose entry with no sections; the sections
live in docs/D10-design-variation.md. The same fix is already applied to
CLAUDE.md, PLAN.md, design-judge.ts, .claude/agents/design-judge.md,
corpus-findings.md and VENDOR.md in 0d0b8b7.

Both files are hook-protected, so this is an operator apply:

    git apply docs/patches/A1/08-section-refs.patch

